  m_text: 'Static - In this gamemode, you traverse the procedurally generated maze
    and shoot the targets you find throughout. Destroy Each Target to Win.


    Hunt
    - In this gamemode, you traverse the maze and hunt the enemies within it, but
    beware for they hunt you too.


    Both gamemodes are timer based so try get
    the objective done as fast as possible.'
